<title>PHILIPPINES: PICOP board approves diversification.</title>
<headline>PICOP board approves diversification.</headline>
<dateline>MANILA 1997-04-15</dateline>
<text>
<p>Philippine timber giant PICOP Resources Inc said on Tuesday its board has approved the firm's diversification into other businesses.</p>
<p>The country's largest industrial timber firm said in a statement its board approved amendments in the firm's primary business to include gold mining and the manufacture of palm oil and cement in its meeting on Monday.</p>
<p>The board of the company also approved proposals to spin off PICOP's paper operations.</p>
<p>--Manila newsroom (632) 841-89-36, fax 817-62-67</p>
